217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 773 0 R
/ActualText (Unchecked exceptions are exceptions that do not need to be declared in the method signature. Unchecked exceptions can be thrown by any method, and the compiler will not generate an error if they are not handled.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
